@@ -58,6 +58,7 @@ <h1>Dosage Regimes</h1>
 <ul>
 <li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-54252">FHIR-54252</a> - Added <code>DosageInstruction.repeatCycle</code> for dosage courses that repeat in cycles (for example, 21 days on and 7 days off), with the section <a href="#repeatcycle">Repeating cycles</a> and an updated Example 5.</li>
 <li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-54340">FHIR-54340</a> - Renamed the <code>DosageDetails</code> data type to <a href="#DosageInstruction">DosageInstruction</a>. The content of the type is unchanged.</li>
+<li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-58907">FHIR-58907</a> (also <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-58386">FHIR-58386</a>) - <code>renderedInstruction</code> stays optional (0..1, reverting FHIR-54014); its definition no longer says it must always be present, and the comment says when it SHOULD be present (when people read and act on the dosage) and that it SHALL be consistent with the structured dosage.</li>
 </ul>
